{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39620","headline":"上李补阙 · 黄滔","name":"上李补阙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十洲非暂别，龙尾肯慵登。\n谏草封山药，朝衣施衲僧。\n月留江客待，句历钓船徵。\n终恐林栖去，飡霞叶上昇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39620.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39620","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}